required-behaviour.logic:
allowed(p) ⇔ ∃ r ∈ T : contained(p, r)
T = C ∪ { d(c) }
where: p = the path that the caller supplies T = the set of trusted roots C = the roots that config.toml declares, after expansion c = the current directory of the MCP server process d(c) = the nearest ancestor of c that holds a project marker contained(x,r) = x resolves inside r allowed(p) = the server accepts p
